                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Last week, I held a Veterans\u2019 Townhall in Fairbanks to hear directly from those who have served our country. \n\nFrom the urgent need for additional Veteran Service Officers (VSOs) to addressing medical access and service delays - Alaska\u2019s Veterans deserve better. \n\nI\u2019m proud to be a Co-Sponsor of the Veterans ACCESS Act of 2025 which would guarantee timely VA appointments or care through community providers. \n\nI will continue to work alongside my colleagues in Congress to ensure veterans receive the dignity, care, and service they\u2019ve earned.",
